          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "暫時活著。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "你，你的夥伴，你的盟友，你的傷患，你的艦船都可以暫時活著。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
